# RetailSync access and RBAC

- Follow `.agents/access-rbac/AGENTS.md`.
- Access workspace currently contains users and roles only.
- Do not present hidden modules as active product areas.
- Client visibility and server permission enforcement must stay aligned.
- Role action lists should come from valid module action catalogs, not free-form text.
